    ZWQgKENPTk5FQ1QgdW5zZXQpIC0+IHBhbmVsIG9ubHkiCmVsaWYgbmMgLXogMTI3LjAuMC4xICIkUCIgMj4vZGV2L2 \
    51bGw7IHRoZW4KICAgIGVjaG8gInNwb29mZXI6ICAgbGlzdGVuaW5nIG9uIDEyNy4wLjAuMTokUCAtPiBwb2ludCB0 \
    aGUgVkxFU1Mgb3V0Ym91bmQgaGVyZSIKZWxzZQogICAgZWNobyAic3Bvb2ZlcjogICBOT1QgbGlzdGVuaW5nIG9uID \
    EyNy4wLjAuMTokUCAtPiByZWFkIHRoZSBjb250YWluZXIgbG9nIgogICAgUkM9MQpmaQoKWyAiJFJDIiAtZXEgMCBd \
    ICYmIGVjaG8gIiIgJiYgZWNobyAiT0s6IHNwb29maW5nIGNhbiB3b3JrIGhlcmUuIgpbICIkUkMiIC1uZSAwIF0gJi \
